<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.3.8">
<l>ettaṉai kālamu mettaṉai yūḻiyu miṉṟoṭu nāḷaiyeṉṟē</l>
<l>ittaṉai kālamum pōykkiṟip paṭṭē ṉiṉiyuṉṉaip pōkaloṭṭēṉ</l>
<l>maittuṉaṉ mārkaḷai vāḻvittu māṟṟalar nūṟṟuva raikkeṭuttāy</l>
<l>cittamniṉ pāla taṟitiyaṉ ṟētiru māliruñ cōlaiyentāy</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>“How much time? How many eons? Today and tomorrow!”</l>
<l rend="indent">all this time I was [caught] in lies.</l>
<l>Now I cannot let you go!</l>
<l>You who caused [your] cousins to prosper</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] destroyed [their] one-hundred enemies.</l>
<l>Do you not know that [my] mind is on you,</l>
<l rend="indent">my Father in Tirumāliruñcōlai?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
